MODULES

    This repo is only used for archiving Surge modules I'm
    maintaining. Modules are either fully made by me or
    branched off from others' work, with licensing information
    included.


HOSTING

    For general use, you can access all the files directly
    on GitHub, including their source code under the Build
    branch. But due to GitHub's limitations, it's not ideal
    for frequent access if you want to stay up to date.

    For that reason, everything is also hosted on Cloudflare
    Pages and automatically updated too! You can access it at:

        https://blob.proxies.foo

    It's more stable and easier too to access.
